{"task_id": "HumanEval/161", "solution": "def solve(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the case of letters in a string, preserving non-letters.\n    If no letters are present, the entire string is reversed.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Helper function to check if the string contains any alphabetic characters.\n    def _has_letters(input_str: str) -> bool:\n        return any(c.isalpha() for c in input_str)\n\n    # Helper function to reverse the case of only alphabetic characters.\n    def _reverse_case_of_letters(input_str: str) -> str:\n        result_chars = []\n        for char in input_str:\n            if char.isalpha():\n                if char.islower():\n                    result_chars.append(char.upper())\n                else:\n                    result_chars.append(char.lower())\n            else:\n                result_chars.append(char)\n        return \"\".join(result_chars)\n\n    if not _has_letters(s):\n        return s[::-1]\n    else:\n        return _reverse_case_of_letters(s)"}
